# NEGATIVE RESULT (documented failed attempt): a same-skeleton 3-node
# stand -> walk -> jog graph is NOT buildable from the Center corpus.
#
# This spec FAILS the strict joint-offset gate:
#   error: PrepareMotionSpaces: joint[4] offset mismatch:
#          reference=(0,-0.269225,0) candidate=(0,-0.4,0)
# i.e. standStill and walkCurve/jogCurve are DIFFERENT skeletons.
#
# Full-offset skeleton groups (md5 of all OFFSET lines):
#   Group A (06ea4620): standStill, standReallyStill, walkCurvedLong
#   Group B (6953dd4e): walkCurve, jogCurve, walkToJog, walkStraightTwiceAsFast,
#                       walkTightCurve, walkMoreCurve, walkSpiral, walkFastSpiral
# Stand exists only in Group A; jog only in Group B. No single rig holds all three,
# so a strict same-skeleton stand->walk->jog graph needs retargeting (forbidden).
# Feasible halves built separately:
#   - walk->jog: specs/credo_walk_jog.pmg_spec (Group B, BUILDS; bridge clip exists)
#   - stand->walk: possible in Group A (standStill + walkCurvedLong, min D~60)
# Kept as the record of the attempt; do not expect this file to validate/build.

node stand 1
registration stand LeftAnkle - 3 0
parameter_metrics stand travel_speed
parameter_calibration stand 9
parameter_support stand simplex
example stand 0.05 ../BVH/standStill.bvh start_frame 1 end_frame 40
example stand 0.07 ../BVH/standReallyStill.bvh start_frame 1 end_frame 40

node walk 1
registration walk LeftAnkle - 3 0
parameter_metrics walk travel_speed
parameter_calibration walk 9
parameter_support walk simplex
example walk 9.9 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh start_frame 127 end_frame 160
example walk 10.0 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh start_frame 125 end_frame 158

node jog 1
registration jog LeftAnkle - 3 0
parameter_metrics jog travel_speed
parameter_calibration jog 9
parameter_support jog simplex
example jog 21.9 ../BVH/jogCurve.bvh start_frame 1 end_frame 24
example jog 21.5 ../BVH/jogCurve.bvh start_frame 3 end_frame 26

# Self-edges: keep each locomotion node loopable.
edge walk walk
edge_phase_range walk walk 0.70 0.95 0.05 0.30
edge_config walk walk 120 234 3 6 41

edge jog jog
edge_phase_range jog jog 0.70 0.95 0.05 0.30
edge_config jog jog 300 600 3 6 41

# Transition edges (the audit target). Thresholds set just above measured raw min D.
edge stand walk
edge_phase_range stand walk 0.60 0.95 0.05 0.40
edge_config stand walk 110 220 4 6 41

edge walk stand
edge_phase_range walk stand 0.60 0.95 0.05 0.40
edge_config walk stand 110 220 4 6 41

edge walk jog
edge_phase_range walk jog 0.60 0.95 0.05 0.40
edge_config walk jog 300 520 4 6 41

edge jog walk
edge_phase_range jog walk 0.60 0.95 0.05 0.40
edge_config jog walk 260 480 4 6 41
